{"id": "q0035", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4030272004, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Louise is an artist and needs to apply a coat of varnish to her latest paintings. Usually it takes 7 minutes for the coat of varnish to dry on one painting. However, today she is using a new varnish and it takes 12 minutes for the coat to dry. How much longer will it take for the coat of varnish on 6 paintings with the new varnish to dry as it would with the old varnish?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0035.wav", "input_sha256": "f84b5f0dca9a1e6009f5429cac4062df2e8b4a6650d730b6451293a1e9550f2e", "input_samples": 442400, "input_s": 27.65, "n_real_chunks": 28, "score": 0.2411, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Old varnish: \\(7 \\text{ minutes} \\times 6 = 42 \\text{ minutes}\\) New varnish: \\(12 \\text{ minutes} \\times 6 = 72 \\text{ minutes}\\) Difference: \\(72 - 42 = 30 \\text{ minutes}\\) Final answer: 30", "expert_answer": "Old varnish:  \n\\(7 \\text{ minutes} \\times 6 = 42 \\text{ minutes}\\)\n\nNew varnish:  \n\\(12 \\text{ minutes} \\times 6 = 72 \\text{ minutes}\\)\n\nDifference:  \n\\(72 - 42 = 30 \\text{ minutes}\\)\n\n**Final answer: 30**", "transcript": "Louise is an artist and needs to apply a coat of varnish to her latest paintings. Usually it takes 7 minutes for the coat of varnish to dry on one painting. However, today she is using a new varnish, and it takes 12 minutes for the coat to dry. How much longer will it take for the coat of varnish on", "asr_s": 1.46, "expert_s": 2.9, "expert_input_samples": 442400, "e