{"id": "q0051", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2702078363, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Gary bought a boat for $9000.  Over the first year it depreciated 30%.  The second year it depreciated another 30%.  The third year it depreciated 20%.  How much is the boat worth after the three years?\n\nShow your work and end with the final numeric answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0051.wav", "input_sha256": "ed2b21ccc3a8461b463e87de9cc78c3e895033650ae31f50c1477c319fb7f2ec", "input_samples": 274800, "input_s": 17.175, "n_real_chunks": 18, "score": 0.197, "act": 0.9985, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Initial value: $9,000 After year 1, depreciates 30%, so it keeps 70%: \\[ 9000 \\times 0.70 = 6300 \\] After year 2, depreciates another 30%: \\[ 6300 \\times 0.70 = 4410 \\] After year 3, depreciates 20%, so it keeps 80%: \\[ 4410 \\times 0.80 = 3528 \\] Final numeric answer: $3,528", "expert_answer": "Initial value: **$9,000**\n\nAfter year 1, depreciates 30%, so it keeps 70%:\n\n\\[\n9000 \\times 0.70 = 6300\n\\]\n\nAfter year 2, depreciates another 30%:\n\n\\[\n6300 \\times 0.70 = 4410\n\\]\n\nAfter year 3, depreciates 20%, so it keeps 80%:\n\n\\[\n4410 \\times 0.80 = 3528\n\\]\n\nFinal numeric answer: **$3,528**", "transcript": "Gary bought a boat for $9,000. Over the first year it depreciated 30%, the second year it depreciated another 30%, the third year it depreciated 20%. How much is the boat worth after the three years? Show your work and end with the final numeric answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.87, "expert_s": 2.4, "expert_input_samples": 274800, "expert_input_s": 17.175, "expert_input_sha256"