{"id": "q0104", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2916162406, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Let $n$ be a positive integer.  What is the greatest possible value of $\\gcd(n + 7, 2n + 1)$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0104.wav", "input_sha256": "c27f56e90b9422f9d1e855d81785113269e96879ee57f4e1d7705a9c61a2fa04", "input_samples": 130600, "input_s": 8.162, "n_real_chunks": 9, "score": 0.9478, "act": 0.996, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The greatest possible value is 6. Since \\[ \\gcd(n+7,n+1)=\\gcd((n+7)-(n+1),\\,n+1)=\\gcd(6,n+1), \\] the gcd can be at most 6. This maximum is achieved when \\(n+1\\) is divisible by 6, e.g. \\(n=5\\): \\[ \\gcd(12,6)=6. \\] Final answer: \\(\\boxed{6}\\)", "expert_answer": "The greatest possible value is **6**.\n\nSince  \n\\[\n\\gcd(n+7,n+1)=\\gcd((n+7)-(n+1),\\,n+1)=\\gcd(6,n+1),\n\\]\nthe gcd can be at most **6**.\n\nThis maximum is achieved when \\(n+1\\) is divisible by 6, e.g. \\(n=5\\):\n\n\\[\n\\gcd(12,6)=6.\n\\]\n\n**Final answer: \\(\\boxed{6}\\)**", "transcript": "Let n dollars be a positive integer. What is the greatest possible value of GCN plus 7 to n plus 1 dollar? Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.81, "expert_s": 4.28, "expert_input_samples": 130600, "expert_input_s": 8.162, "expert_input_sha256": "c27f56e90b9422f9d1e855d81785113269e96879ee57f4e1d7705a9c61a2fa04", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 3.732, "relay_synth_ms": 49142, "onset_chunk": 8, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 358, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 358, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0104_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "afe0d82d37d46629b6743132a41845887b6efc1c7436aebc702bbd578657ae60", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 86.72}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0104_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "f644d3022e74daa42d1ad4dd94d511f4982e90cf456a64cb445be6b9044f5b65", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0104_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "f916f8020a9170c011a936b4631f77361c79e8b19d958f72551f99782bca06c1", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.84}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.073, 1.133, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.075, 2.137, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.081, 3.144, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.077, 4.14, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.076, 5.14, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.082, 6.145, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.078, 7.14, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.081, 8.144, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 8.162, 8.236, 8.867, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.162, 9.643, 10.223, 0, 20160, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 8.162, "last_real_feed_done": 8.236, "onset": 8.867, "gate_read_done": 8.867, "fire": 8.867, "candidate_first_pcm": 8.867, "stall_note": 8.868, "stall_first_pcm": 9.521, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 10.223, "expert_req": 8.868, "expert_resp": 13.955, "relay_synth_start": 13.955, "relay_first_pcm": 14.804, "relay_synth_end": 63.098, "first_any_pcm": 8.867, "first_answer_pcm": 14.804, "session_end": 63.442}, "ttfa_answer_s": 6.641, "ttfa_any_s": 0.704}
{"id": "q0126", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1911101640, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 6, "query": "Find the modulo $7$ remainder of the sum $1+3+5+7+9+\\dots+195+197+199.$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0126.wav", "input_sha256": "777b2daabeec03c9bc1ff2e86551ca302bdd003f8b670f9976fc6392b1497e33", "input_samples": 146600, "input_s": 9.162, "n_real_chunks": 10, "score": 0.7095, "act": 0.9977, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The sum is the first 100 odd numbers: \\[ 1+3+5+\\cdots+199 = 100^2 = 10000 \\] Now find the remainder modulo 7: \\[ 10000 \\div 7 = 1428 \\text{ remainder } 4 \\] Final answer: \\(\\boxed{4}\\)", "expert_answer": "The sum is the first 100 odd numbers:\n\n\\[\n1+3+5+\\cdots+199 = 100^2 = 10000\n\\]\n\nNow find the remainder modulo 7:\n\n\\[\n10000 \\div 7 = 1428 \\text{ remainder } 4\n\\]\n\n**Final answer: \\(\\boxed{4}\\)**", "transcript": "Find the modulo seven dollars remainder of the sum one plus three plus five plus seven plus nine plus dots plus one ninety-five plus one ninety-seven plus one ninety-nine. Solve and give the final answer.\n", "asr_s": 0.95, "expert_s": 8.43, "expert_input_samples": 146600, "expert_input_s": 9.162, "expert_input_sha256": "777b2daabeec03c9bc1ff2e86551ca302bdd003f8b670f9976fc6392b1497e33", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 8.093, "relay_synth_ms": 28799, "onset_chunk": 9, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 287, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 287, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0126_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "28ad56a42c72fb4f69c49da321cd83735f57f135cbd8